OL,3,ALockerbie bombing suspect seized from
OL,4,ALibya in 'cloak and dagger' operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lockerbie bombing suspect has claimed
OL,7,Fhe was illegally removed from Libya to
OL,8,Fstand trial in the United States after
OL,9,F"a cloak and dagger operation conducted
OL,10,Fin the dead of night".
OL,12,FAbu Agila Mohammad Mas'ud Kheir
OL,13,FAl-Marimi has alleged he was abducted
OL,14,Fby armed men and handed over "hooded
OL,15,Fand bound" to FBI agents, who had a
OL,16,Fplane waiting to fly him out of the
OL,17,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
