OL,3,ALockerbie bombing suspect seized from
OL,4,ALibya in 'cloak and dagger' operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAl-Marimi, also known as Mas'ud, has
OL,7,Fdenied building and priming the bomb
OL,8,Fthat brought down Pan Am Flight 103
OL,9,Fover Lockerbie on 21 December 1988,
OL,10,Fkilling 270 people.
OL,12,FThe Libyan argues he was the victim of
OL,13,Fan unlawful rendition and has asked a
OL,14,Fjudge in Washington DC to throw the
OL,15,Fcase out of court.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
